# this project's out-of-repo folders and its haxe server port, read by the Makefiles (`include`), tools/env.py
# and tools/env.mjs. full real paths, never a symlink (links trigger permission prompts in new sessions, and
# ~/Projects is itself one).
# FORMAT: KEY=value, no quotes, no space around '=', no trailing space. the Yandex paths hold a space: quote every
# use in a recipe ("$(TEXTURES_SRC)"), never pass one through a Make function (wildcard, dir, notdir, foreach split
# on spaces), and never `source` this file in a shell.
# the docs' shorthand names map onto these: parasite/ = BUILD, app/ = BUILD/resources/app, textures-src/ =
# TEXTURES_SRC, models-src/ = MODELS_SRC, sounds-src/ = SOUNDS_SRC, ai-src/ = AI_SRC, ObsidianReports/ =
# OBSIDIAN_REPORTS. SOUNDS_SRC and MODELS_SRC are also written into .mcp.json (the fal-sfx and runware-trellis-2
# output dirs): change them there too
HAXE_PORT=6000
# the electron dist (unpacked zip, the dev install); `make` stages the app into BUILD/resources/app
BUILD=/mnt/c/YandexDisk/PC LIGHTSTAR/Projects/parasite-v42.1.0-win32-x64
# the asset store (Yandex Disk): raw generations and sources, never in git
TEXTURES_SRC=/mnt/c/YandexDisk/PC LIGHTSTAR/Projects/Parasite/Assets/Textures-src
MODELS_SRC=/mnt/c/YandexDisk/PC LIGHTSTAR/Projects/Parasite/Assets/Models-src
SOUNDS_SRC=/mnt/c/YandexDisk/PC LIGHTSTAR/Projects/Parasite/Sounds-src
AI_SRC=/mnt/c/YandexDisk/PC LIGHTSTAR/Projects/Parasite/Assets/AI
# the store's root: the original kra/png art tools/entities128.py packs
ASSETS_SRC=/mnt/c/YandexDisk/PC LIGHTSTAR/Projects/Parasite/Assets
# the Obsidian vault folder `make report` copies reports/ into
OBSIDIAN_REPORTS=/mnt/c/YandexDisk/Obsidian/Parasite/reports
# the itch browser demo `make -C src www-demo` stages into
ITCH_DEMO=/mnt/c/YandexDisk/PC LIGHTSTAR/Projects/Parasite/ItchDemo
# the release kit: the Electron runtimes and root bits the Steam depots and itch zips take beside the game
RELEASE_KIT=/mnt/c/YandexDisk/PC LIGHTSTAR/Projects/Parasite/_Build_
